hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"182","Allāhumma bārik lahum fīmā razaqtahum, waghfir lahum warḥamhum.. O Allah, bless them in what You have provided them, forgive them, and have mercy on them."
"183","Allāhumma aṭ`im man aṭ`amanī wasqi man saqānī. O Allah, feed the one who has fed me, and give drink to the one who has given me drink. Reference: Muslim 3/126."
